  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Sensation 16 is a classic value-oriented multifilament built from highly elastic nylon fibers for comfort, easy power and improved playability. Two outer wraps applied in opposite directions reinforce the string and improve durability. The 1.30 mm / 16 gauge version is thicker than Sensation 17, making it the more durable and slightly more controlled option while retaining the arm-friendly character that has made Sensation a long-standing multifilament choice.",

    "zh": "Wilson Sensation 16 是一款经典、性价比较高的多芯球线，采用高弹性尼龙纤维来提供舒适、易获得的力量和良好可打性。球线外层采用两组反向缠绕结构，以提升整体耐久和结构稳定性。1.30 毫米 / 16 Gauge 比 Sensation 17 更粗，因此更耐打、控制更稳定，同时继续保持 Sensation 系列标志性的 Arm-Friendly 柔和特性。"
  },

